### Course materials (never publish to a public/shared repo) ###
# Lecture slides, briefs, and other SMU-provided course content are the
# university's/lecturer's copyrighted material, not ours to redistribute —
# keep all of it out of version control regardless of where it lives in the
# tree. Matched by folder name (not by file extension) so legitimate project
# deliverables like exported diagrams or design docs elsewhere in the repo
# aren't silently swallowed too.
Materials/
materials/
**/course-materials/
**/CourseMaterials/
**/Course Materials/
